Project: Phera - Indian Wedding Platform
Stack: Next.js + Material Design 3 + Framer Motion
Reference @PROJECT_SETUP.md for all implementation details
Focus: Mobile-first, Google integrations, cultural design

### CRITICAL DESIGN RULES:
- Modals: Always white bg with dark (#1a1a1a) text.
- Inputs Focus: Always use primary pink border (#DE3F5E).
- Text: All input and body text must be dark/black by default.